# `agents.get`

Raw agent doc from disk at the requested scope (opaque doc_json wrapper).

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`AgentDoc` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |
| `doc_json` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.get --json '{ "id": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "rust-lane",
  "scope": "project",
  "doc_json": "{\"agent\":{\"name\":\"Rust Lane\",\"description\":\"Full Rust implementation lane.\"},\"skills\":{\"refs\":[\"run\",\"verify\"]},\"permissions\":{\"preset\":\"ship-standard\"}}"
}
```
